# =============================================================================
# Mutation Microscope — Optional AlphaGenome API Environment Template
# =============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURAL NOTE:
# Mutation Microscope is an offline-first application. The production web app
# (served via Vercel) and local React/Vite development server require ZERO API keys
# and run entirely from the precompiled, provenance-tracked static dataset:
#   src/data/variants.json
#
# Neither the Python dataset pipeline (scripts/generate_dataset.py) nor the
# React/Vite client automatically loads `.env` files.
# Copying this file to `.env` will NOT configure or run the application.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUPPORTED USAGE (Developer-side pipeline only):
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALPHAGENOME_API_KEY is only used if you explicitly run the developer pipeline
# in live query mode:
#   uv run scripts/generate_dataset.py --fetch-live
#
# The script reads directly from your process environment via `os.environ`.
# To supply your key in macOS or Linux shells, export it in your terminal:
#
#   export ALPHAGENOME_API_KEY="your_alphagenome_api_key_here"
#   uv run scripts/generate_dataset.py --fetch-live
#
# Register for an API key at:
#   https://deepmind.google.com/science/alphagenome/
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY WARNINGS:
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. NEVER commit API keys or files containing credentials to git.
# 2. NEVER prefix this variable with `VITE_` (e.g. `VITE_ALPHAGENOME_API_KEY`).
#    Vite exposes all `VITE_*` variables directly into client-side JS bundles.
# 3. NEVER add this variable to client-facing Vercel deployment settings.
#    The production web client is completely static and has zero secret dependencies.
# =============================================================================
